{{KRExclusive}}
'''Stealth Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]]. This unit was the winner of   [[PONOS Campaigns/The OutCats|The OutCats]] campaign for the Korean Version, voted for by fans. It was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 788
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Stealth Cat
|name2 = Surprise Stealth Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Surprise Stealth Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Stealth Cat is borderline useless in most situations due to a combination of Single Attack, painfully low range, mediocre speed and very long backswing, usually precluding it from attacking more than once. It can act as good counterplay to [[One Horn]]/[[Bore]] in Normal Form and [[Cyberhorn]]/[[Nimoy Bore]] in Evolved Form, but that's as far as it goes, and superior alternative CC units already exist. A 28-second recharge time puts the last nail in its coffin.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

