==Trivia==
*Stealth Cat's concept may be a reference to how [[wikia:metalgear:Cardboard box|cardboard boxes]] are used in the ''[[wikipedia:Metal Gear|Metal Gear]]'' series of games.
*Surprise Stealth Cat is based off of the [[wikipedia:Jack-in-the-box|jack-in-the-box]] toy.
**Surprise Stealth Cat also happens to bear a striking resemblance to a finalist from the [[PONOS Campaigns/YourBattleCat Design Contest|#YourBattleCat Design Contest]], even down to the stars on the box, though this may be a coincidence.
*Surprise Stealth Cat's paint job is reminiscent of [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]].
*Surprise Stealth Cat has the second longest attack frequency in the game, being beaten out by only [[Ancient Egg: N112 (Rare Cat)|Cat Egg Pod]].

